  },
  "procedure": [
    "Clone https://github.com/LoHhhha/LATO.2 and run `. ./setup.sh --all` (conda env, Python 3.10, PyTorch 2.6, CUDA 12.4, nvcc needed)",
    "Download weights with `python scripts/ckpt_download.py` (from huggingface.co/0x4c48/LATO.2)",
    "Mesh to mesh: `python scripts/e2e_inference.py --mesh_dir <dir> --out_dir <out> --vert_num 2000`",
    "Image to mesh: `python scripts/image_e2e_inference.py --image_dir <dir> --out_dir <out> --vert_num 2000`",
    "Or try it without installing: https://huggingface.co/spaces/0x4c48/lato2-mesh-generation"
